            "review_title": "Review at Tenku - Japanese Modern Kaiseki & Bar",
            "review_text": "Libertalie Bastiat\nLugano, Switzerland309 contributions\n0\nAn enchantment\nMay 2026 • Couples\nWe celebrated my husband’s birthday together. The Wagyu Lovers 11 litter menu set. We feasted from beginning to end.\nEverything went very well, from the welcome to the goodbye, kindness and kindness was omnipresent. The dishes were refined and served elegantly as well as the presentation. Each scope has been illustrated and detailed. \nThe view of Ho Chi Minh was enchanting. We felt like kings on top of their tower. It is very romantic for all occasions.\nIt really felt like we received more than we paid. In the end we were even surprised by a cupcake with a candle it touched my husband a lot.\nThank you very much to everyone we will come back.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from French\nShow original\nWritten May 9, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-05",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
