            "review_title": "Review at Tenku - Japanese Modern Kaiseki & Bar",
            "review_text": "Kim Lien Le\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam60 contributions\n0\nRandom party full of fun\nNov 2023 • Family\nMy son booked lunch at the 66th floor of Landmark 81 but there was no more room. The receptionist recommended two Japanese restaurants in the building and we chose Tenku on the 67th floor.\nTenku has a rich menu, delicious dishes that are beautifully decorated, wonderful views of Saigon and quite professional waiters and waitresses. The most impressive thing was when they knew it was my birthday, the restaurant prepared a cake, music and warm and respectful wishes.\nWe will return to Tenku restaurant with our friends\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten November 6, 2023",
            "rating": 5.0,
